.claude-audit-digest-*.md

# local one-off scratch tooling (asset generators, etc.)
.scratch/

# Local seeding extraction outputs (openly licensed, but not repo content)
germany-units.json
osm-tattoo-*.json
overture-*.json
*-units.json

# Root-anchored: local supabase-CLI scratch created by running `npx supabase`
# from the repo root (the real project lives at apps/web/supabase). Its
# .temp/start-secrets/ carries local-stack keys that must never enter history.
/supabase/
